 "scope": "Append-only registry of the lane code a layer-verdict return outside the grandfathered 2026-09-22 wave may name in its provenance (2026-09-23 verdict-integrity review). tools/sota-convergence/record_verdicts.py accepts a Claude return only when its (workflow_path, workflow_sha256) is listed here and equals the current examples/claude-native/workflows/SHA256SUMS entry of the listed vendored_path, and a Codex return only when its (codex_lane_py_sha256, prompt_sha256) is listed here and equals this checkout's codex_lane.py and lane-prompt.md; scripts/landscape.py re-checks every sealed new-wave return against this list in CI. Append an entry (never edit or remove one) when codex_lane.py, lane-prompt.md or the vendored workflow changes; tests/test_verdict_lane_vendoring.py fails until the current bytes are listed. The \"adjudication\" list registers adjudicate.py, adjudication-prompt.md, both adjudication schemas, adjudication-lane.js and the vendored blind-adjudicator.md by sha256; record_verdicts.py and scripts/landscape.py refuse a new-wave adjudication whose provenance names unlisted code (append an entry when any of them changes)."
